  "analysis": "\n\n• **Atelier Bois & Co (d5, d6 | €6 250)**\n  - *Ambiguity/Settlement:* d5 (`\"Chantier : 4 rue du Port\"`) and d6 (`\"Meuble de rangement salle de stérilisation\"`) lack clear entity linkage. Settles if owner confirms d5 is LMNP and d6 is SELARL.\n  - *Q:* Are the 4 rue du Port install and sterilization cabinet respectively for LMNP and SELARL?\n  - *A/Rules:* Yes → always file d5 as `lmnp-port/works.invoice`, d6 as `selarl-morel/works.quote`. No → depends on discriminator (site address).\n• **Prévia Assurances (d1, d2, d3 | €1 704 + €18 412 value)**\n  - *Ambiguity/Settlement:* d1 (`\"Prélèvement sur le compte FR76...\"`), d2 (`\"Assuré : M. Paul Morel\"`), and d3 (`\"Souscripteur : SELARL\"`) mix personal/business. Settles if owner confirms d1/d3 are business, d2 is personal.\n  - *Q:* Confirm d1/d3 are business provident/pension, and d2 is purely personal?\n  - *A/Rules:* Yes → always file d1/d3 as `selarl-morel/insurance.*`, d2 as `paul/insurance.life`. Mixed → depends on discriminator (insured person).\n• **Banque Rivage (d4 | €650 rent)**\n  - *Ambiguity/Settlement:* Joint personal account receives LMNP rent (`\"LOYER 4 RUE DU PORT MAI 650,00\"`). Settles if owner confirms account collects LMNP rents.\n  - *Q:* Is this account used to collect LMNP rents?\n  - *A/Rules:* Yes → always file as `lmnp-port/bank.statement`. No → depends on discriminator (account holder).\n• **Orélia Télécom (d7 | €40)**\n  - *Ambiguity/Settlement:* Fibre line at LMNP address billed to Paul (`\"Titulaire : M. Paul Morel\"`). Settles if owner confirms line is for LMNP.\n  - *Q:* Is this internet line for LMNP operations?\n  - *A/Rules:* Yes → always file as `lmnp-port/telecom.bill`. No → ask each time.",
